WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.812
Are you available for a meeting tomorrow?

00:00:03.062 --> 00:00:07.249
In the morning, yes. After lunch, I have an appointment.

00:00:07.499 --> 00:00:09.723
Does ten work for you?

00:00:09.973 --> 00:00:12.550
Yes. I will prepare the documents.

00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:15.806
Thank you. The meeting will be online.
